@startuml MoodRefreshment_Sequence_MoodLog
actor User
participant "MoodCheckScreen" as UI
participant "MoodProvider" as Ctx
participant "Express API" as API
database "MoodEntries" as DB

User -> UI : Submit mood check-in
UI -> Ctx : addMood(mood, energy, ...)
Ctx -> API : POST /api/moods\n{userId, mood, energy, stress, sleep, tags}
API -> DB : INSERT MoodEntries
DB --> API : new row
API --> Ctx : saved entry JSON
Ctx -> Ctx : setMoodHistory + cache AsyncStorage
Ctx -> Ctx : computeStreak / weekly / badges
Ctx --> UI : updated insights
UI --> User : Success + navigate Home/Insights
@enduml
